# Frontend Scope Rules

## Current Status

The frontend is intentionally parked. The backend is the product right now.

## What Is Acceptable Frontend Work

- Bug fixes that block backend validation
- Adding a minimal UI element to expose a new backend capability for testing
- API integration for a new endpoint

## What Is NOT Acceptable Frontend Work Right Now

- UI redesign or polish
- New UI components not directly tied to a backend capability
- Performance optimization of the frontend
- Adding frontend libraries or dependencies

If asked to improve the frontend significantly, redirect to backend work first.
The frontend will be revisited once the backend capability pipeline is stable.
